{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:10:35+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starwisp Hyperdrive", "steam_appid": 1844080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844080/extras/718376416bc487a9f08ad4c38a712fd9.avif?t=1793958876\" width=600 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starwisp Hyperdrive is in early access - you might encounter bugs, and sections still being completed. Let us know in the Steam forums or our discord server about bugs and feedback! To check out what other features are coming soon, see the early access section above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've inherited a spaceship! But there's one or two teeny tiny little problems.... It's a bit of a fixer upper. It has a bad reputation. Government agents seem to take a strange interest. Also, it appears to be haunted. Aside from that, it's your cozy new home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starwisp Hyperdrive is a cozy space life-sim that's more about the journey than the destination. Keep your ship fueled, repaired and flying. Take care of your character - they need food, rest and the occasional shower! Mine asteroids, salvage derelicts, fabricate parts and trade to keep flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844080/extras/643a2e7fe2738b00b2619b0d28a29221.poster.avif?t=1793958876\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844080/extras/643a2e7fe2738b00b2619b0d28a29221.webm?t=1793958876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your destination! Hopefully you have enough fuel to get where you want to go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If not you might want to visit a trader... before you leave port, of course.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name, create and customize your character. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through space and explore the system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on jobs at various spaceports.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix your ship and try not to die alone in space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow alien plants in the botany room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience space depression!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly to asteroids and mine stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fabricate parts and cook food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conduct inadvisable experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with your robot buddies. As in, <i>you</i> can bond... but the robot is an unfeeling machine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix your broken machine parts and robots! Or scrap them, if you want. You monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rearrange your cargo bay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to random space weirdos. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently in Early Access, Wishlist or join our discord server! (It's listed over in the developer info.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play on controller, Steam Deck and Steam Machine<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844080/extras/a54b572434d354cf30d79768d0ee7c8b.avif?t=1793958876\" width=800 height=450 /></span></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.a