e, create and customize your character. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through space and explore the system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on jobs at various spaceports.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix your ship and try not to die alone in space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow alien plants in the botany room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience space depression!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly to asteroids and mine stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fabricate parts and cook food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conduct inadvisable experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with your robot buddies. As in, <i>you</i> can bond... but the robot is an unfeeling machine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix your broken machine parts and robots! Or scrap them, if you want. You monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rearrange your cargo bay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to random space weirdos. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently in Early Access, Wishlist or join our discord server! (It's listed over in the developer info.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play on controller, Steam Deck and Steam Machine<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1844080/extras/a54b572434d354cf30d79768d0ee7c8b.avif?t=1793958876\" width=800 height=450 /></span></h2>", "short_description": "A cozy sci-fi life sim where you play as a spaceship captain piloting your Shufflewing through a whimsical universe with your cat and robot crew member. Keep your hyperdrive fueled, stock up on food, and maintain the ship's machinery. Mine resources, analyse samples, print parts and more!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/18